cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "SplitGuard-AD: provenance-aware splitting and patient-leakage auditing for medical imaging cohorts"
abstract: >-
  Patient-wise splitting is only as reliable as the identifier that defines a
  patient. SplitGuard-AD builds a leakage graph from whatever identity evidence
  a cohort still carries, treats its connected components as indivisible, and
  audits a split before training rather than after.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mehmetberkeisler/SplitGuard-AD"
keywords:
  - patient-identity leakage
  - data provenance
  - evaluation protocol
  - medical imaging
  - reproducibility
  - Alzheimer's disease
